{"4381950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chickenfinger's Rally", "steam_appid": 4381950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple yet complex simulator-ish driving game, with the goal being to drive as far as possible and collect money to buy vehicles, levels and upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381950/extras/ed89ee43218808a9808ea78e75517613.avif?t=1777682221\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Be careful though, as it is easy to damage or even total your car if you don't watch it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381950/extras/7749a98b4a1fa6d9b2431e04db1221b2.avif?t=1777682221\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features a beautiful and detailed weather system, with real time of day, and auto generated weather patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381950/extras/94cf0f83f22195abfa7702cd2c49716e.avif?t=1777682221\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of awesome vehicles and levels to choose from too, including the Leopard 1A5, my favorite tank &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381950/extras/b3f47047d8007fe6ec146becc7450e1c.avif?t=1777682221\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main menu is quite detailed, and gives you plenty of useful info on your vehicle, as well as cheesy descriptions written by yours truly.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\